    "_comment": "Block parabolic / late-stage setups. Encoded from VRT failure May 18 (entry $367 → SL $336 same-day, -7.9% on AI-leader sell-off). VRT was +27% in 6 weeks, +38% above 50-DMA, RSI > 75 — pure narrative momentum with no technical health.",
